								<BinaryString name="SerializedOverrides"></BinaryString>
								<int64 name="SourceAssetId">-1</int64>
								<SharedString name="Tags">yuZpQdnvvUBOTYh1jqZ2cA==</SharedString>
								<UniqueId name="UniqueId">73c8afe78d24b4d30afced1100000593</UniqueId>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="439">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Alert.card

Ask for a short decision.

Inside an app mount, set `local UI = app.UI`.

```luau
UI.Alert "Alert" { title = "Continue?", isPresented = Facet.Compose.cell(true), actions = { { id = "close", label = "Close", onActivate = function() end } } }
```

Key options: `title`, `actions`, `isPresented`.

Use a typed action array when literal roles need strict types.

Facet gives the `role = "default"` action the `emphasis` appearance, so do not
style the commit action yourself.

Related controls: [Controls](Controls.md).

Open:

- [Alert.reference](Alert.reference.md)
- [Tasks.confirm](Tasks.confirm.md): use a Dialog when the server must accept the choice.
]]></string>
