```

Key options: `label`, `selected`, `onToggle`, `onRemove`.

Choose one binding shape.

Related controls: [Controls](Controls.md).

Open:

- [Chip-and-ShortcutHint](Chip-and-ShortcutHint.md)
]]></string>
