						<Item class="StringValue" referent="504">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[### Composition and Region

<!-- aliases: Composition and Region | composition-and-region -->

Open one option group below. Each group gives part of this contract.

Open:

- [Composition.adaptation](Composition.adaptation.md)
