								<SharedString name="Tags">yuZpQdnvvUBOTYh1jqZ2cA==</SharedString>
								<UniqueId name="UniqueId">73c8afe78d24b4d30afced110000061a</UniqueId>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="574">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[# Label

Label.summary option values and behavior.

| Control | Main contract |
|---|---|
| `Label` | An icon and a title in a row. `title` is required, and it is the accessible name. Also `icon`, `presentation`, `iconSize`, `textSize`, `gap` and `iconPosition`. See [Label](Label.reference.md). |
]]></string>
