						<Item class="StringValue" referent="688">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Value"><![CDATA[### Selection

<!-- aliases: Selection | selection -->

Open one option group below. Each group gives part of this contract.

The controls use `GuiService.SelectedObject` for keyboard and gamepad focus.
The engine moves the selection with the D-pad and the arrow keys. Facet adds
these rules:

Open:

- [Selection.FacetSelectionOwner](Selection.FacetSelectionOwner.md)
- [Selection.SelectedObject](Selection.SelectedObject.md)
- [Selection.SelectionGroup](Selection.SelectionGroup.md)
]]></string>
								<BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString>
